<title>USA: Washington Mutual Q1 diluted shr $0.93.</title>
<headline>Washington Mutual Q1 diluted shr $0.93.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.93		    $0.74</p>
<p> Net		 114,072		  88,807</p>
<p> Revs		n/a			n/a</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   120,292,563	    117,216,977</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Analyst consensus for first quarter net share earnings was $0.89, according to First Call.</p>
<p>The company said its provision for loan losses were $15.5 million versus $20.9 million.</p>
<p>The company said its total assets were $46.05 billion versus $44.55 billion.</p>
<p>The company said its total deposits were $24.30 billion versus $24.08 billion.</p>
</text>
